Z||000013||Oreif||11-04-2000||10:29 AM||||The SE had a 4cyl as the standard engine and the V-6 as an option. The 86/87 SE's looked like the 85 GT. Aero nose and ground effects.<BR>As for your 9 listing, The car was owned by 4 owners and at 2 dealerships. No other problems with vehicle.<P>Haze, Your link for the Carfax page gives me an error.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>If anyone uses Haze's link change the "2" to a "1" in the address link and you can get a full report for free.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <A HREF="http://www.carfax.com/cfm/PromoPage1.cfm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.carfax.com/cfm/PromoPage1.cfm</A>  <P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 11-04-2000).]||||reg||1
